Package: opal-bridge
Version: 0.2.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jean LE QUELLEC <jean.le.quellec@gmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: relayd
Description: Dual-personality GL-SFT1200 (Opal): true L2 WiFi-to-Ethernet
 bridge (BRIDGE) or untouched stock GL.iNet router (ROUTER), selected by the
 physical slide switch - read at boot, hot-toggled while running. Dynamic
 subnet discovery, zero hardcoded IPs, opal.local mDNS alias, LED state
 language. hi = BRIDGE, lo = ROUTER.
